SAML Plugin for DokuWiki

Provides user authentication against a SAML 2.0 identity provider,
for example Keycloak, Active Directory Federation Services (ADFS)
or Shibboleth.

All documentation for this plugin can be found at
https://www.dokuwiki.org/plugin:saml

If you install this plugin manually, make sure it is installed in
lib/plugins/saml/ - if the folder is called different it
will not work!

Please refer to https://www.dokuwiki.org/plugins for additional info
on how to install plugins in DokuWiki.

